    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "your start in politics in 1979. You were first elected to the Fairfax County Board of Supervisors. Can you tell us about what inspired you to get involved in that? Yeah,",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
