        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Emotional regulation is essential for maintaining credibility and influence in political engagement.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a strategic advantage in refraining from direct confrontation even when provoked.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
